                  </attributes>
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this unit would be destroyed, before removing it from play, roll a dice. On a 3+, this unit is not destroyed and any remaining damage points inflicted on it have no effect. Then, Heal (D3) this unit. This unit cannot use this ability again for the rest of the battle.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
